{
  "meta": {
    "collected": "2026-08-12",
    "source": "Etsy Marketplace Insights (Shop Manager > Stats > Marketplace insights), LasercutSupplier shop, Etsy Plus",
    "why_this_matters": "This is FIRST-PARTY Etsy data, the same source as findings/etsy-first-party-search-data. It gives the wiki's core metric - searches per 1000 listings - for 3D-printing terms on exactly the same basis as the layered-SVG terms, so the two niches are directly comparable. No third-party keyword tool is involved.",
    "extraction": "the numbers are embedded in the server-rendered page as initial_data.marketplace_insights_search.stats; fetched same-origin and parsed, no UI scraping",
    "fields": {
      "term": "search term",
      "searches_30d": "searches in the last 30 days, Etsy's own count",
      "listings": "avgTotalListings - Etsy's own competing-listing count for the term",
      "per_1000": "searches_30d / listings * 1000 - the wiki's demand-per-supply metric",
      "cvr_rating": "Etsy's conversion-rate rating, integer. Observed 0-4; the UI labelled cvr=1 as 'Low'. Higher is better. The exact label for each integer is NOT confirmed beyond 1='Low'.",
      "query_cvr_permille": "Etsy's queryCvr x 1000, i.e. sales per 1000 searches"
    },
    "caveats": [
      "cvr_rating's full label scale is unverified - only cvr=1 was seen labelled ('Low') in the UI. Do not translate the other integers into words without checking.",
      "'print in place' returned 9 searches against 68,747 listings. That is almost certainly Etsy treating the phrase as three common words rather than a real query - treat as unusable, not as a finding.",
      "'ams multicolor stl' failed to parse (term probably has no data).",
      "Searches are 30-day totals for the Etsy marketplace as a whole, not per-country.",
      "A high per_1000 with a low cvr_rating means people look and do not buy - lithophane, gridfinity and 3d printed lamp are all in that quadrant."
    ]
  },

